[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3246.23, "timestamp": "00:54:06", "text": "他擁有這一切。  還剩一個敵人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3251.27, "timestamp": "00:54:11", "text": "。  我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3252.63, "timestamp": "00:54:12", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3258.549, "timestamp": "00:54:18", "text": "抓住他，狗！  哦，這延遲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3266.309, "timestamp": "00:54:26", "text": "我的天啊。對不起。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3277.052, "timestamp": "00:54:37", "author": "@Forger_Rajwa", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/BTAmYAQNElBDX67_wLNBc68QtNI-g-1PDX-lA_3rYoLT9O_0R414aqvBsLyyRlClvOQtyXmW7Q=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "woahhh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3278.47, "timestamp": "00:54:38", "text": "我當時覺得他好像要殺了你。  沒關係。延遲太嚴重了。  我的天啊。  兄弟，他當時真的太難搞了。我當時有點害怕。  是啊，真熱。  因為你就像對著牆壁射擊一樣，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3292.309, "timestamp": "00:54:52", "text": "我想慢跑慢跑。去慢跑吧。拿著。拿著。拿著。  是的。是的。"}]